values ('ap_calculus_ab', 1, '1.2', array['1.2', '1.3', '1.4', '1.9']::text[], 'list_sequence', 'Ways a limit can be expressed', 'A limit can be expressed graphically, numerically, and analytically, and students must interpret and move between these.', '[{"label": "Graphically", "meaning": "Read from the graph of the function near x = c."}, {"label": "Numerically", "meaning": "Estimate from a table of values near x = c."}, {"label": "Analytically", "meaning": "Write and evaluate using limit notation and algebra."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-calculus-ab-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_calculus_ab-u1-r1-005; ced=LIM-1.B.1 A limit can be expressed in multiple ways, including graphically, numerically, and analytically.')
