values ('ap_calculus_ab', 1, '1.6', array['1.6', '1.7']::text[], 'list_sequence', 'Algebraic manipulation strategies for limits', 'Rearrange an expression into an equivalent form before evaluating the limit, using these strategies.', '[{"label": "Factor and divide common factors", "meaning": "Used for rational functions."}, {"label": "Multiply by the conjugate", "meaning": "Multiply by an expression involving the conjugate of a sum or difference to simplify functions involving radicals."}, {"label": "Alternate trigonometric forms", "meaning": "Use equivalent forms of trigonometric functions."}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-calculus-ab-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_calculus_ab-u1-r1-011; ced=LIM-1.E.1 It may be necessary or helpful to rearrange expressions into equivalent forms before evaluating limits.')
