values ('ap_calculus_ab', 1, '1.8', array['1.8', '1.7']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Squeeze theorem', 'The limit of a function may be found with the squeeze theorem, which requires confirming that the function is bounded between two functions with the same limit at c.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'State and verify the conditions (the bounding inequality near c and equal limits of the bounding functions) before concluding.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-calculus-ab-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_calculus_ab-u1-r1-012; ced=LIM-1.E.2 The limit of a function may be found by using the squeeze theorem.')
