values ('ap_calculus_ab', 1, '1.14', array['1.14']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Infinite limits and vertical asymptotes', 'The limit concept extends to infinite limits, and asymptotic and unbounded behavior of functions can be described and explained using limits.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-calculus-ab-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_calculus_ab-u1-r1-020; ced=LIM-2.D.1 / LIM-2.D.2 The concept of a limit can be extended to include infinite limits.')
